   Content basis: REQ-CONT-001 / REQ-CONT-002 (SRC-041, Ch. 10 — "Идентифициране на емоции").
   Topic drawn from the approved content map's "Модул 5 — Емоции и телесни реакции" entry
   (18_INFORMATION_ARCHITECTURE.md), housed here as Lesson 3 of the flagship Module 2 per
   REQ-CONT-002 ("2–4 lessons in the flagship module") and ADR-009 — see 03_DECISION_LOG.md.
   Example is original, neutral, non-clinical — not adapted from code_artifact.html or copied
   from any source. Global lesson-template redesign (Session 21) — added a small emotion↔body
